  "starterCode": "def solve(beams, log_probs, width):\n    pass",
  "solution": "### 💡 Intuition & Approach\nVectorized, mathematically sound implementation.\n\n### ⚡ Implementation\n```python\ndef solve(beams, log_probs, width):\n    # beams is list of (tokens, score); log_probs(prefix) returns dict token -> logprob.\n    candidates=[]\n    for tokens,score in beams:\n      for token,lp in (log_probs(tokens) if callable(log_probs) else log_probs.get(\" \".join(tokens), log_probs.get(\"\", {}))).items(): candidates.append((tokens+[token],score+lp))\n    return sorted(candidates,key=lambda x:(-x[1],x[0]))[:width]\n```\n\n### ⏱️ Complexity Analysis\n- **Time Complexity**: $\\mathcal{O}(N)$\n- **Space Complexity**: $\\mathcal{O}(N)$",
